Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.64,0:07:53.01,IN-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur3\fn@华文仿宋\frz270\an1\pos(30,30)\fsp0}這顆孤獨的心 該何去何從
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.37,0:07:59.47,IN-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur3\fn@华文仿宋\frz270\an1\pos(30,30)\fsp0}那一天的輕輕一吻
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.61,0:08:04.52,IN-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur3\fn@华文仿宋\frz270\an1\pos(30,30)\fsp0}緊緊相擁時同步的心跳
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.54,0:08:08.92,IN-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur3\fn@华文仿宋\frz270\an1\pos(30,30)\fsp0}分明還揮之不去
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.86,0:08:16.17,IN-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur3\fn@华文仿宋\frz270\an1\pos(30,30)\fsp0}心愛的你相伴的夏日已結束
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.20,0:08:21.59,IN-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur3\fn@华文仿宋\frz270\an1\pos(30,30)\fsp0}帶來的回憶 都回歸青空
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.63,0:08:27.18,IN-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur3\fn@华文仿宋\frz270\an1\pos(30,30)\fsp0}耀眼而溫柔 令我怦然心動
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.23,0:08:32.62,IN-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur3\fn@华文仿宋\frz270\an1\pos(30,30)\fsp0}那音容與夢想 我將繼續找尋
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.23,0:08:42.07,IN-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur3\fn@华文仿宋\frz270\an1\pos(30,30)\fsp0}Stay 再給片刻停留
